wf-atmos-shield-name = Atmospheric Bubble Projector
wf-atmos-shield-description = A unique device capable of clipping over your uniform. It creates an atmospheric bubble, protecting the user from space and other environmental hazards. The bubble will pop easily under attack. Internals recommended.
wf-atmos-shield-action-name = Toggle atmospheric projector
wf-atmos-shield-action-description = Engage or disengage the atmospheric projector.
